egory_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"fy-vfMF2fQywsIyA3yJQoQ","review_id":"gAER2vBiEHkQ-LkT9j2kyQ","date":"2017-06-20T22:36:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9458795785903931,"text_excerpt":"I finally got to check out this spot yesterday and I really liked it. Owned by a family member of a friend of mine, I'd been meaning to check it out since it opened. I went at kind of an off time (6:00 on a Monday evening), so it wasn't very crowded when my wife and I walked in. There were a few people sitting at the bar, but we were the only group at a table. First, the beer: They have a reasonably-sized menu with enough choices for there to be a good variety, but it's not such a huge list that it's intimidating. With craft brews from around Louisiana and even the rest of the country, there's something here for everyone. I appreciate that they offer smaller sizes (10 oz, I believe) so th..."},{"business_id":"fy-vfMF2fQywsIyA3yJQoQ","review_id":"PYwyRtMpRt4sUBO-q6b8wQ","date":"2017-01-06T02:20:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9455913305282593,"text_excerpt":"Had dinner at Freret Beer Room on the last night of an eight-day visit to NOLA, and it was one of my favorite meals of the trip! Visited with a party of five and service was efficient and friendly. I'm not a beer expert, but I thought the beer list was pretty wide-ranging, and they'll bring you a taste of a beer or two if you're not sure what you'd like. They also have small and large sizes of some beers, which is also nice if you'd like to sample a couple beers over the course of your meal. The most pleasant surprise of our evening was the food - it was excellent! I'd especially recommend the broccoli appetizer and the fried chicken sandwich. The sandwiches are quite filling. Others at o..."},{"business_id":"fy-vfMF2fQywsIyA3yJQoQ","review_id":"OdsA8h2Kph7bt3jio7iyeA","date":"2018-03-19T15:45:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.943545401096344,"text_excerpt":"Really solid spot - my family and I greatly enjoyed it. The place has a local, hip vibe and a comfortable, homey feel. Chloe took care of us and was friendly, fun and quick with a smile and a recommendation. Love her! They were nice enough to create a macaroni and cheese dish for my daughter, who was in the mood and she was a fan. Beer list was impressive, with a great combination of local faves and awesome craft offerings. The menu wasn't extensive but there was plenty of good choices. The fried chicken sandwich, known as the O.G., came highly recommended and I can understand why. Delicious and impressive looking, although I could have used some fries or a side of something. Would have l..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"fy-vfMF2fQywsIyA3yJQoQ","photo_id":"mGrkZZz9oyCmwWF3U0ox7g","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/mGrkZZz9oyCmwWF3U0ox7g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9086670875549316},{"business_id":"fy-vfMF2fQywsIyA3yJQoQ","photo_id":"dzBGFGLkUlAYfTgaM365sw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/dzBGFGLkUlAYfTgaM365sw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8948559165000916},{"business_id":"fy-vfMF2fQywsIyA3yJQoQ","photo_id":"HtNEVkKVpXRUh4bSw7bJwQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/HtNEVkKVpXRUh4bSw7bJwQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8473501801490784},{"business_id":"fy-vfMF2fQywsIyA3yJQoQ","photo_id":"FK1mOCix9XhKpXlFNaQj_g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/FK1mOCix9XhKpXlFNaQj_g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8304164409637451},{"business_id":"fy-vfMF2fQywsIyA3yJQoQ","photo_id":"nMxtGUHkoafVz2I9NOGdHw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/nMxtGUHkoafVz2I9NOGdHw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7543634176254272}]},"notebook_case":null}
